-- STEP 5: Dashboard Viewer role
-- ============================================================
----------------------------------------------------IT Operations Maturity V2 - Dashboard access role----------------------------------------------
-- The account/project-wide Dashboard (Account -> Project -> domains/parameters
-- across the WHOLE account, not just the viewer's own assessor/reviewer
-- assignments) is gated behind a new grantable ITOPS_ROLE, same mechanism as
-- every other IT Ops role - an admin hands it out from Configure Roles (Step 1)
